    <marc:datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
      <marc:subfield code="a">An educational program by the Discovery Channel School which teaches key concepts in a middle grade science curriculum. Each CD-ROM features science simulations, discovery channel theater, library of updated World Book encyclopedia, laboratory and multimedia studio. Includes a teacher&apos;s guide. In this interactive CD-ROM, students are taken on an interesting journey into the world of reptiles, from the Florida Everglades and South America&apos;s rainforests to Africa&apos;s River Nile and Southeast Asia</marc:subfield>
    </marc:datafield>
